   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I found out that it&#39;s a vega issue <a href=\"https://github.com/trifacta/vega/issues/122\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/trifacta/vega/issues/122&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484808377000&amp;usg=AOvVaw33k5ckTu8oQuBSMzFkBcnd\">here</a>. <div><br></div><div>I can work this out by using segments, but ggvis doesn&#39;t support segments at the moment. Can someone think of a workaround to this issue?</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
