Am I missing something? <br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-TOXjNgVm9bc/VJLdACKossI/AAAAAAAAAVk/tA2IEbCu87s/s1600/ggplot_diff_color.png\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-TOXjNgVm9bc/VJLdACKossI/AAAAAAAAAVk/tA2IEbCu87s/s1600/ggplot_diff_color.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484808377000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ueyQBMFvrLqVF9Un7hRtL\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-TOXjNgVm9bc/VJLdACKossI/AAAAAAAAAVk/tA2IEbCu87s/s400/ggplot_diff_color.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"181\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-ZnVFi1LvizM/VJLerRIh0oI/AAAAAAAAAV0/mrqY40X_ftU/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2014-12-18%2Bat%2B4.02.04%2BPM.png\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-ZnVFi1LvizM/VJLerRIh0oI/AAAAAAAAAV0/mrqY40X_ftU/s1600/Screen%252BShot%252B2014-12-18%252Bat%252B4.02.04%252BPM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484808377000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3YGrqr3AsqpiZYyi-k-Ame\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-ZnVFi1LvizM/VJLerRIh0oI/AAAAAAAAAV0/mrqY40X_ftU/s400/Screen%2BShot%2B2014-12-18%2Bat%2B4.02.04%2BPM.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"237\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p></div></blockquote></div></div>"
